Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Agentic OS <dev@agentic.os>
Depends: libc6
Description: Agentic OS desktop shell
 A declarative, transaction-backed desktop served by the agentd control
 plane. Every UI edit is validated, logged, and reversible.
